*CloseGroup: FinishingSettings

*OpenGroup: DetailedSettings/Quality

*OpenUI *CN_DPI/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 60.0 AnySetup *CN_DPI
*DefaultCN_DPI: 600dpi
*CN_DPI 1200dpi/1200 dpi: "<</HWResolution [1200 1200]>> systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*CN_DPI 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution [600 600]>> systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*CloseUI: *CN_DPI

*OpenUI *GSmooth/Gradation Smoothing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50.0 AnySetup *GSmooth
*DefaultGSmooth: Default
*GSmooth Default/Printer Default: ""
*GSmooth Off/Off: "<</PostRenderingEnhance true /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 
<</Type 44 /GradationSmoothing <</Text 0 /Graphics 0 /Image 0>> >> >>  
systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
*GSmooth Fine/Smooth 1: "<</PostRenderingEnhance true /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 
<</Type 44 /GradationSmoothing <</Text 0 /Graphics 1 /Image 0>> >> >>  
systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
*GSmooth Rough/Smooth 2: "<</PostRenderingEnhance true /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 
<</Type 44/GradationSmoothing <</Text 0 /Graphics 2 /Image 0>> >> >>  
systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
*CloseUI: *GSmooth

*OpenUI *Gscale/Grayscale Conversion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50.0 AnySetup *Gscale
*DefaultGscale: Default
*Gscale Default/Printer Default: ""
*Gscale SRGB/sRGB: "<</DeviceRenderingInfo 
<</Type 36 /GrayScaleConversion 1>> >> systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
*Gscale NTSC/NTSC: "<</DeviceRenderingInfo 
<</Type 36 /GrayScaleConversion 2>> >> systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
*Gscale UnifrmRGB/Uniform RGB: "<</DeviceRenderingInfo 
<</Type 36 /GrayScaleConversion 3>> >> systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
*CloseUI: *Gscale

*OpenUI *WidthAdjustment/Width Adjustment: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50.0 AnySetup *WidthAdjustment
*DefaultWidthAdjustment: Default
*WidthAdjustment Default/Printer Default: ""
*WidthAdjustment Off/Off: "<</PostRenderingEnhance true /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 
<</Type 44 /DeviceLineAdjustment 2>> >>
 systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
*WidthAdjustment On/Thicken: "<</PostRenderingEnhance true /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 
<</Type 44 /DeviceLineAdjustment 1>> >>
 systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
*CloseUI: *WidthAdjustment

*OpenUI *TonerSave/Toner Save: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50.0 AnySetup *TonerSave
*DefaultTonerSave: Default
*TonerSave Default/Printer Default: ""
*TonerSave Off/Off: "<</PostRenderingEnhance true /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 
<</Type 44 /TonerSaver 0>> >> systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
*TonerSave On/On: "<</PostRenderingEnhance true /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 
<</Type 44 /TonerSaver 1>> >> systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
*CloseUI: *TonerSave

*OpenUI *AdvancedSmooth/Advanced Smoothing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50.0 AnySetup *AdvancedSmooth
*DefaultAdvancedSmooth: Default
*AdvancedSmooth Default/Printer Default: ""
*AdvancedSmooth Off/Off: "<</PostRenderingEnhance true 
/PostRenderingEnhanceDetails <</Type 44 /AdvancedSmoothing 
<</Text 0 /Image 0 /Graphics 0>> >> >> systemdict /setpagedevice get exec"
*End
